  <description promeva:title="Description (English)" promeva:type="104" type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The key objective of the Acute Joint Response is to provide lifesaving activities in response to COVID-19. The core activities focus on key sectors such as FSL, Health, WASH, MPC. The ECJR is targeting the affected people by the C-19 pandemic in the following regions: Addis Ababa, Somali region, Amhara, Kelafo, Gode Town, Adadle, West and Arsi zone, Oromia region.  CARE  is focusing on FSL and WASH sector and working through a local partner called MCDP.</narrative>
  </description>
